    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d20">

                <pb facs="0099" n="23" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg23"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 810.51/597</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Stimson to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-04-03">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 3, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>High Commission opened in Chamber of Deputies. Speech by President; response by
                    Secretary McAdoo and other presidents of commissions, alphabetically. Twenty
                    countries. Great éclat. All diplomats present, including those of belligerent
                    countries.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
